timestamp=2026-11-27T08:10:25.580Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/logs/server-side.log <<'EOF'\n2026-11-27T08:08Z Session32: builds unchanged (account 970b5e85…; Site Manager main-0.b06362b8…; www dpl=e1f4c3c3…). Diffed 105 bundle API paths vs inventory; extras on out-of-scope *.svc hosts. New in-scope endpoint GET account.svc /zendesk/tickets/closed: A/B each see only own closed ticket; requester_id/user/page ignored; unauth 401 -> Not Vulnerable (no BOLA).\n2026-11-27T08:10Z Session32: A re-escalated to L2. Cross-account DELETE B session -> 404 No SessionMetadata; B trusted device -> 404; B TOTP/email authenticator -> 404 (B MFA unchanged); POST/DELETE B picture -> 403 mismatching UUID; PUT -> 405. No IDOR/BAC.\n2026-11-27T08:12Z Session32: POST sso /verify,/verify/verification-code,/search/email,/search/username,/password -> 404 on sso.ui.com (bundle base sso.ubnt.com out of scope); /api/sso/v2/users -> 400 captcha/attestation gate. No server-side HTML reflection on account/sso/activate; www 404 reflects URL only in escaped meta. No high-impact finding; no Discord.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-11-27T08:10:25.580Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/inventory/endpoints.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Session 32 additions (builds unchanged; untested in-scope endpoints)\n| Method | Path | Host | Auth | Status | Result / notes |\n|--------|------|------|------|--------|----------------|\n| GET | /zendesk/tickets/closed | account.svc | session/L1 | 200 | A -> only A's closed ticket; B -> only B's; `requester_id`/`user`/`page` overrides ignored; unauth 401. No BOLA |\n| DELETE | /api/sso/v1/user/self/sessions/{id} | sso | A L2 | 404 | cross-account B session id -> `No SessionMetadata matches`; body `session_ids`/`user` override no effect |\n| DELETE | /api/sso/v1/user/self/trusted_devices/{id} | sso | A L2 | 404 | cross-account B device -> `Not found` |\n| DELETE | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/{totp,email}/{id} | sso | A L2 | 404 | cross-account B authenticator -> not found; B MFA list unchanged |\n| POST/DELETE | /api/sso/v1/user/{uuid}/picture | sso | A | 403 | cross-account B uuid -> `mismatching UUID`; PUT -> 405 |\n| POST | /api/sso/v2/users | sso | none | 400 | registration still requires `_ubiquiti_private_key` + captcha + apple_devicecheck_token |\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/{verify,verify/verification-code,search/email,search/username,password} | sso | none | 404 | not routed on sso.ui.com (bundle base sso.ubnt.com, out of scope); GET /search/email/{email} remains the documented existence oracle |\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-11-27T08:10:25.580Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/unresolved.md <<'EOF'\n\n## 19. Session 32 — new in-scope endpoint and cross-account write checks (all negative)\n- `GET https://account.svc.ui.com/zendesk/tickets/closed` was the only bundle API path missing\n  from the inventory. It is correctly session-scoped: A sees only A's closed ticket, B only\n  B's; `requester_id`, `user`, and `page` overrides do not widen scope; unauthenticated 401.\n  **Not Vulnerable (no BOLA).**\n- With A escalated to L2, cross-account writes remain blocked: `DELETE` B's session -> 404\n  (`No SessionMetadata matches`), B's trusted device -> 404, B's TOTP/email authenticator ->\n  404 (B MFA unchanged); `POST`/`DELETE` B's picture -> 403 `mismatching UUID` (`PUT` 405).\n- SSO `verify`/`verification-code`/`search`/`password` POST bodies return 404 on `sso.ui.com`\n  because the current bundle's SSO base is `sso.ubnt.com` (out of scope); registration\n  (`/api/sso/v2/users`) still requires the private key + captcha + devicecheck attestation.\n- No server-side HTML reflection of markers on account/sso/activate; `www.ui.com` 404 reflects\n  the URL only inside escaped `content=` meta attributes. The credentialed-CORS item (1)\n  therefore still has no attacker-controlled `*.ui.com` origin and remains **blocked**.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
