timestamp=2026-11-27T08:11:49.585Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/server-side/account.ui.com/session32-ledger.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Passkey / WebAuthn gating (new coverage)\n| Method | Path | Auth | Result | Verdict |\n|--------|------|------|--------|---------|\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn | A L1 | 499 L2_REQUIRED | Not Vulnerable (no pre-MFA passkey registration) |\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn | A L2 | 200 creates `status:pending` webauthn authenticator + creation options | Expected; pending key not usable |\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn/options | A L1/L2 (no verified key) | 404 \"User or verified keys not found\" | Not Vulnerable (pending registration cannot log in) |\n| DELETE | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn/{pending id} | A L2 | 204 (cleanup) | — |\n\nPasskey registration requires L2, so a password-only / pre-MFA session cannot add a passkey\nto bypass email OTP. The pending authenticator was deleted after testing (A MFA list restored).\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-11-27T08:11:49.585Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/inventory/endpoints.md <<'EOF'\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn | sso | A L1 | 499 | passkey registration requires L2 (`L2_REQUIRED`); no pre-MFA/L1 passkey enrollment |\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn | sso | A L2 | 200 | creates `pending` webauthn authenticator + creation options; not usable for login until verified; test key deleted (204) |\n| POST | /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn/options | sso | A | 404 | `User or verified keys not found` when no verified passkey; pending key cannot be used -> no MFA bypass |\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-11-27T08:11:49.585Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/logs/server-side.log <<'EOF'\n2026-11-27T08:11Z Session32: POST /user/self/mfa/webauthn L1 -> 499 L2_REQUIRED; L2 empty body -> pending webauthn authenticator + creation options; /mfa/webauthn/options 404 when no verified key (pending not usable). No pre-MFA passkey enrollment / MFA bypass. Pending key deleted (204), A MFA list restored.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-11-27T08:11:49.585Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat >> result/unresolved.md <<'EOF'\n- **Passkey/WebAuthn (Session 32):** `POST /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn` is L2-gated\n  (L1 -> 499 `L2_REQUIRED`), so a password-only/pre-MFA session cannot enroll a passkey to\n  bypass email OTP. An L2 request creates a `pending` authenticator, but\n  `/mfa/webauthn/options` returns 404 (`User or verified keys not found`) and the pending key\n  is not usable for login. Test key deleted afterwards. Not Vulnerable.\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
timestamp=2026-11-27T08:11:49.585Z level=INFO run=7b92c3ba message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - <<'PY'\n# append a short note to the Session 32 SUMMARY and progress sections\nsp='result/SUMMARY.md'\ns=open(sp).read()\ns=s.replace(\"  Ledger: `result/server-side/account.ui.com/session32-ledger.md`.\\n\",\n\"  Ledger: `result/server-side/account.ui.com/session32-ledger.md`.\\n- **Passkey/WebAuthn:** `POST /api/sso/v1/user/self/mfa/webauthn` is L2-gated (L1 -> `499`);\\n  an L2 request creates only a `pending` authenticator and `/mfa/webauthn/options` returns\\n  `404` (no verified key), so there is no pre-MFA passkey-enrollment MFA bypass. Test key\\n  deleted (`204`).\\n\")\nopen(sp,'w').write(s)\npp='result/progress.md'\ns=open(pp).read()\ns=s.replace(\"- Status: **57 routes unchanged (42 done / 15 blocked)**. No new high-impact finding;\\n  `confirmed-vuln.txt` unchanged; no Discord notification.\\n- Ledger: `result/server-side/account.ui.com/session32-ledger.md`;\\n  evidence: `result/server-side/account.ui.com/traffic/session32-*.txt`.\\n\",\n\"- Passkey/WebAuthn: registration L2-gated (L1 -> 499); L2 creates only a pending key, not\\n  usable for login (options 404). No MFA bypass; test key deleted.\\n- Status: **57 routes unchanged (42 done / 15 blocked)**. No new high-impact finding;\\n  `confirmed-vuln.txt` unchanged; no Discord notification.\\n- Ledger: `result/server-side/account.ui.com/session32-ledger.md`;\\n  evidence: `result/server-side/account.ui.com/traffic/session32-*.txt`.\\n\")\nopen(pp,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"summary/progress updated\")\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
